### Process Structured Payload (Shopify)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/webhooks/structured/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderId": "1001",
    "customer": "Jane Doe",
    "total": 50.00
}

### Process Unstructured Payload (WhatsApp)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/webhooks/unstructured/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000?userId=987654321
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": "I want to order a burger, my name is Alice, deliver to 456 Elm St, phone 555-1234"
}
